Charlie & the Skills Factory
============================

The `grill-me` and `componentise` skills are original work.

The `spec`, `tickets`, `spike`, `deep-review` and `handover` skills were
written from scratch for this project, but the ideas behind them - and the
workflow they form together - are derived from Matt Pocock's
"Skills for Real Engineers":

    https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock

No text from that project is reproduced here. The notice is kept as credit
for the original thinking.
